<title>USA: U.S. Defense Secretary Perry may visit Gulf region.</title>
<headline>U.S. Defense Secretary Perry may visit Gulf region.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defence Secretary William Perry may travel to the Gulf region this weekend to discuss the Iraq situation with U.S. friends and allies there, adminstration officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;A trip is under consideration for Secretary Perry (but) a final decision has not been made,&quot; one official told Reuters.</p>
